{"content":[{"c":["JEROHAM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Levite of the family of Kohath, father of Elkanah and a forefather of the prophet Samuel and Heman the singer. Heman was a musician in the sanctuary during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.1.1","r":"1Sam.1.1","rawR":"1Sam.1.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.1.1","value":"1Sam.1.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 1:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.27,34","r":"1Chr.6.27,34","rawR":"1Chr.6.27,34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.27,34","value":"1Chr.6.27,34"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:27, 34"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Benjamite whose sons lived in Jerusalem and were leaders among their people (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.27","r":"1Chr.8.27","rawR":"1Chr.8.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.27","value":"1Chr.8.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:27"},"). He is perhaps identical with #3 below."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Benjamite and Ibneiah’s father. Ibneiah, head of his family, returned to Jerusalem from exile in Babylon (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.8","r":"1Chr.9.8","rawR":"1Chr.9.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.8","value":"1Chr.9.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Descendant of Pashhur and the father of Adaiah the priest. Adaiah returned to Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.12","r":"1Chr.9.12","rawR":"1Chr.9.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.12","value":"1Chr.9.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:12"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.12","r":"Neh.11.12","rawR":"Neh.11.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.12","value":"Neh.11.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Benjamite from Gedor whose two sons, Joelah and Zebadiah, came to David’s support at Ziklag (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.7","r":"1Chr.12.7","rawR":"1Chr.12.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.7","value":"1Chr.12.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Father of Azarel, the chief official of the Danites during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.22","r":"1Chr.27.22","rawR":"1Chr.27.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.22","value":"1Chr.27.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Father of Azariah, one of the commanders who was instrumental in removing Queen Athaliah from Judah’s throne to make way for Joash (Jehoash), the rightful claimant (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","r":"2Chr.23.1","rawR":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.23.1","value":"2Chr.23.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 23:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jeroham","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Sm 1:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.1.1","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.1.1","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.1.1"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:27, 34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.27,34","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.27,34","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.27,34"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.27","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.27","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.8","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.8","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.12","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.12","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.12"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.12","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.12","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.12"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 12:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.22"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 23:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.23.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"676d4bcb783f7c73507e5646dacc76204fe0246a5de77d23542ad25577cdc8bc","sourceItemName":"Jeroham","sourceItemOrder":198,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jeroham","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jeroham","title":"Jeroham","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}